"parcels from £8.69",{"link_type":50,"key":51,"kind":52,"id":53,"url":54,"name":55,"size":56},"Media","ecc92d96-8cbc-4316-b11c-6501e52478e4","file","ZCwNmBEAACIAAJpg","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdf0da68b-7584-4eca-a656-20f4b8338e1a_destination_countries_030423.csv","destination_countries_030423.csv","5329","27",{"dimensions":59,"alt":62,"copyright":46,"url":63,"id":64,"edit":65},{"width":60,"height":61},88,24,"Send","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$cd3af6b2-fb95-491b-a05c-94e836958075","international_hero_banner",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":73,"primary":75,"id":114,"slice_type":115,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[74],{},{"CardImage":76,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":86,"CardText":87,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":112,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":80,"copyright":46,"url":81,"id":82,"edit":83},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,670,"Skyline photo of Rome, Italy","italy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdfa599cd-86ae-4315-ae56-263a3e1f147d_1000x670px_Italy.jpg?auto=compress,format","Zh_CGBEAACcAq6Wh",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":84},"#fff","none","Shipping from the UK to Italy",[88,93],{"type":89,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":92},"paragraph","Italy is the third-largest economy in Europe and one of the UK’s top trading partners. Its major cities, like Milan, Rome and Naples, are some of the most popular destinations for UK shippers.",[],"ltr",{"type":89,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":92},"Whether you’re sending parcels to Italy for business or personal reasons, we make it as easy, and as cheap as possible. We send parcels to 200+ countries and territories across the world, including Italy’s neighbouring countries. So you can send parcels to France, or ship parcels to Switzerland from the UK.",[96,103,106,111],{"start":97,"end":98,"type":99,"data":100},240,263,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":101,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Ffrance","_blank",{"start":104,"end":98,"type":105},241,"strong",{"start":107,"end":108,"type":99,"data":109},268,307,{"link_type":36,"url":110,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fswitzerland",{"start":107,"end":108,"type":105},{"link_type":113},"Any","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":117,"primary":138,"id":151,"slice_type":152,"slice_label":46},[118,123,128,133],{"column_1_cell":119,"column_2_cell":120,"column_3_cell":121,"column_4_cell":122},"250g","£9.65","£8.69","£0.96",{"column_1_cell":124,"column_2_cell":125,"column_3_cell":126,"column_4_cell":127},"500g","£10.60","£9.49","£1.11",{"column_1_cell":129,"column_2_cell":130,"column_3_cell":131,"column_4_cell":132},"1kg","£11.90","£10.69","£1.21",{"column_1_cell":134,"column_2_cell":135,"column_3_cell":136,"column_4_cell":137},"2kg","£12.30","£11.69","£0.61",{"SectionTitle":139,"SectionSubtitle":140,"TableFooter":141,"InformationTableButtonUrl":142,"InformationTableButtonText":145,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":146,"column_name_1":147,"column_name_2":148,"column_name_3":149,"column_name_4":150},"Cheap shipping to Italy","When sending a parcel to Italy, you’ll always receive great service for a low price with us. Plus, you can send packages up to 15kg. See how cheap it is to send based on some of our more popular weights:","*Royal Mail prices quoted are for an International Tracked delivery of a small 1kg parcel to Italy vs a tracked Evri parcel of the same weight. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fprices2026 on 14\u002F05\u002F2026. Other features of the services, including transit times and compensation levels, will differ. Different terms and conditions will apply.",{"link_type":36,"key":143,"url":144},"97af2a2a-502c-4ed1-8e1a-0419b2125043","\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Italy",true,"Weight","Royal Mail","Evri","Savings","information_table_v2$b2caf688-4090-4589-a65b-7d71650007ea","information_table_v2",{"variation":154,"version":31,"items":155,"primary":157,"id":219,"slice_type":115,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[156],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":158,"CardText":159,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":218,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled national holidays in Italy",[160,163,169,174,179,183,188,192,197,202,206,210,215],{"type":89,"text":161,"spans":162,"direction":92},"When you’re shipping from the UK to Italy with Evri, we'll aim to deliver your parcels as quickly as possible. If your parcel is in transit around the following Italian national holidays, delivery times may be increased:",[],{"type":164,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":92},"list-item","New Year's Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[167],{"start":66,"end":168,"type":105},16,{"type":164,"text":170,"spans":171,"direction":92},"Epiphany – 06\u002F01\u002F2026",[172],{"start":66,"end":173,"type":105},10,{"type":164,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":92},"Easter Monday – 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[177],{"start":66,"end":178,"type":105},15,{"type":164,"text":180,"spans":181,"direction":92},"Liberation Day – 25\u002F04\u002F2026",[182],{"start":66,"end":168,"type":105},{"type":164,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":92},"International Workers' Day – 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[186],{"start":66,"end":187,"type":105},29,{"type":164,"text":189,"spans":190,"direction":92},"Republic Day – 02\u002F06\u002F2026",[191],{"start":66,"end":178,"type":105},{"type":164,"text":193,"spans":194,"direction":92},"Assumption Day – 15\u002F08\u002F2026",[195],{"start":66,"end":196,"type":105},17,{"type":164,"text":198,"spans":199,"direction":92},"All Saints' Day – 01\u002F11\u002F2026",[200],{"start":66,"end":201,"type":105},18,{"type":164,"text":203,"spans":204,"direction":92},"Immaculate Conception – 08\u002F12\u002F2026",[205],{"start":66,"end":61,"type":105},{"type":164,"text":207,"spans":208,"direction":92},"Christmas Day – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[209],{"start":66,"end":168,"type":105},{"type":164,"text":211,"spans":212,"direction":92},"St Stephen's Day – 26\u002F12\u002F2026",[213],{"start":66,"end":214,"type":105},19,{"type":89,"text":216,"spans":217,"direction":92},"Italy also hosts many regional holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":113},"card$79bafa05-6acc-4cb5-81b8-31a6e5ea4258",{"variation":221,"version":31,"items":222,"primary":285,"id":296,"slice_type":297,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[223,245,264],{"Title":224,"Description":229,"Image":233,"Label":46,"UrlText":227,"Url":241,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":244,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[225],{"type":226,"text":227,"spans":228},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[230],{"type":89,"text":231,"spans":232,"direction":92},"Book your parcel online and drop off at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. You can also print your label in-store for free using our Print in ParcelShop devices. Prefer to book in person? Visit us at selected Post Offices.",[],{"dimensions":234,"alt":236,"copyright":46,"url":237,"id":238,"edit":239},{"width":78,"height":235},665,"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm their parcel has been accepted.","italy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2423.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&w=1000&h=665","Z6TI7pbqstJ9-TfZ",{"x":240,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},38,{"link_type":36,"key":242,"url":243},"1566f50b-8b6a-4ce1-b930-e5265dc7336a","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":113},{"Title":246,"Description":250,"Image":254,"Label":46,"UrlText":248,"Url":260,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":263,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[247],{"type":226,"text":248,"spans":249},"Lockers",[],[251],{"type":89,"text":252,"spans":253,"direction":92},"Send parcels to Italy by booking online and choosing an Evri Locker near you to drop off your parcel. Simply scan your barcode, place your parcel in an available Locker and we'll send it on its way.",[],{"dimensions":255,"alt":256,"copyright":46,"url":257,"id":258,"edit":259},{"width":78,"height":235},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","italy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":196,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":261,"url":262},"06f950bc-4052-4e9c-86e5-fe63527f51be","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":113},{"Title":265,"Description":269,"Image":273,"Label":46,"UrlText":280,"Url":281,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":284,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[266],{"type":226,"text":267,"spans":268,"direction":92},"Courier collection",[],[270],{"type":89,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":92},"With our courier service,  you can book your parcel to be collected straight from your home or office. We'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us to arrive.",[],{"dimensions":274,"alt":275,"copyright":46,"url":276,"id":277,"edit":278},{"width":78,"height":235},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","italy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=26%2C0%2C7672%2C5102&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw",{"x":279,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},26,"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":282,"url":283},"fbf776ec-bc78-4136-85f9-31609f40fd42","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":113},{"SectionTitle":286,"SectionDescription":291,"theme":295},[287],{"type":288,"text":289,"spans":290},"heading2","What to do when shipping from the UK to Italy",[],[292],{"type":89,"text":293,"spans":294},"There are three ways of sending parcels to Italy with Evri:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$62a61fdb-6414-49b8-b8bd-fc8d7bb00432","article_link_module",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":299,"primary":301,"id":330,"slice_type":115,"slice_label":46},[300],{},{"CardImage":302,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":309,"CardText":310,"ButtonText":327,"ButtonUrl":328,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":303,"alt":304,"copyright":46,"url":305,"id":306,"edit":307},{"width":78,"height":235},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","italy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":66,"y":308,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,"Sending multiple parcels to Italy",[311,314,318,321,324],{"type":89,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":92},"Whether it’s for business or personal sending, you can send multiple parcels to Italy at once with the following steps:",[],{"type":315,"text":316,"spans":317,"direction":92},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":315,"text":319,"spans":320,"direction":92},"Package up your items and book your parcels in one go",[],{"type":315,"text":322,"spans":323,"direction":92},"Print off your postage label at home or in-store for free",[],{"type":315,"text":325,"spans":326,"direction":92},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ UK ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":329,"url":38},"8efe0c6f-b001-43d5-b627-3111e95dcd76","card$13f1cdce-eecd-438c-a3c7-1b0034f48673",{"variation":332,"version":31,"items":333,"primary":413,"id":417,"slice_type":418,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[334,353,365,377,389,401],{"title":335,"content":336,"icon":346},"Regular tracking updates",[337],{"type":89,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[340,345],{"start":341,"end":342,"type":99,"data":343},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":344,"target":102},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":341,"end":342,"type":105},{"dimensions":347,"alt":349,"copyright":46,"url":350,"id":351,"edit":352},{"width":348,"height":348},40,"Phone icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":354,"content":355,"icon":359},"Parcel cover",[356],{"type":89,"text":357,"spans":358,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":360,"alt":361,"copyright":46,"url":362,"id":363,"edit":364},{"width":348,"height":348},"Money icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":84},{"title":366,"content":367,"icon":371},"Customs made easier",[368],{"type":89,"text":369,"spans":370,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":372,"alt":373,"copyright":46,"url":374,"id":375,"edit":376},{"width":348,"height":348},"Passport icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":84},{"title":378,"content":379,"icon":383},"Flexible printing options",[380],{"type":89,"text":381,"spans":382,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":384,"alt":385,"copyright":46,"url":386,"id":387,"edit":388},{"width":348,"height":348},"Printer icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":84},{"title":390,"content":391,"icon":395},"Bulk send",[392],{"type":89,"text":393,"spans":394,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":396,"alt":397,"copyright":46,"url":398,"id":399,"edit":400},{"width":348,"height":348},"Laptop icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":402,"content":403,"icon":407},"Trusted by top UK brands",[404],{"type":89,"text":405,"spans":406,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":408,"alt":409,"copyright":46,"url":410,"id":411,"edit":412},{"width":348,"height":348},"Success icon","italy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":414,"title":415,"description":416},"standard","Why should you choose Evri for Postage to Italy?","You’ll enjoy all of these great benefits when choosing Evri to deliver your parcels to Italy:","list_block$5c6a971e-0dc2-4d34-9ff0-da0a89570039","list_block",{"variation":154,"version":31,"items":420,"primary":422,"id":449,"slice_type":115,"slice_label":46},[421],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":423,"CardText":424,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":448,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Italy",[425,433],{"type":89,"text":426,"spans":427,"direction":92},"There are some restrictions to keep in mind when sending parcels to Italy. Just read our prohibited items list to find out what you can and can’t send to this country, and others.",[428,432],{"start":429,"end":430,"type":99,"data":431},89,110,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":102},{"start":429,"end":430,"type":105},{"type":89,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":92},"You should also check the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to ensure you are fully up-to-date on any international sending restrictions.",[436,440,441,444],{"start":279,"end":437,"type":99,"data":438},58,{"link_type":36,"url":439,"target":102},"italy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":279,"end":437,"type":105},{"start":442,"end":443,"type":105},66,94,{"start":445,"end":443,"type":99,"data":446},67,{"link_type":36,"url":447,"target":102},"italy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"link_type":113},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":154,"version":31,"items":451,"primary":453,"id":495,"slice_type":115,"slice_label":46},[452],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":454,"CardText":455,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":494,"IsEco":20},"Address format for sending parcels to Italy",[456,459,462,465,468,471,474,478,482,486,491],{"type":89,"text":457,"spans":458},"When you’re sending a parcel to Italy, you'll need to use the correct address structure laid out below:",[],{"type":164,"text":460,"spans":461},"The recipient's surname followed by their first name",[],{"type":164,"text":463,"spans":464},"The street name followed by the house number",[],{"type":164,"text":466,"spans":467},"The postcode and town followed by the two-letter abbreviation for the province",[],{"type":164,"text":469,"spans":470},"The country name in capitals",[],{"type":89,"text":472,"spans":473},"For example:",[],{"type":89,"text":475,"spans":476},"Bloggs Joe",[477],{"start":66,"end":173,"type":105},{"type":89,"text":479,"spans":480},"via Garibaldi 27",[481],{"start":66,"end":168,"type":105},{"type":89,"text":483,"spans":484},"47037 RIMINI RN",[485],{"start":66,"end":178,"type":105},{"type":89,"text":487,"spans":488},"ITALY",[489],{"start":66,"end":490,"type":105},5,{"type":89,"text":492,"spans":493},"But don’t worry, as long as you have the address information above, our automated address tool will do all the work for you to produce a label for your parcel in the right format.",[],{"link_type":113},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":497,"primary":566,"id":568,"slice_type":569,"slice_label":46},[498,504,522,554],{"questionTitle":499,"questionBody":500},"How long does it take to ship from the UK to Italy?",[501],{"type":89,"text":502,"spans":503,"direction":92},"Sending a parcel to Italy from the UK with Evri takes 6-9 days on average.",[],{"questionTitle":505,"questionBody":506},"Will I need to deal with customs when posting to Italy",[507,510,513],{"type":89,"text":508,"spans":509,"direction":92},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":89,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":92},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":89,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[516,521],{"start":517,"end":518,"type":99,"data":519},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":520,"target":102},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":517,"end":518,"type":105},{"questionTitle":523,"questionBody":524},"Is there an import tax from the UK to Italy?",[525,528,537,540,543,546,549],{"type":226,"text":526,"spans":527,"direction":92},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":89,"text":529,"spans":530,"direction":92},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[531,536],{"start":532,"end":533,"type":99,"data":534},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":535,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":532,"end":533,"type":105},{"type":89,"text":538,"spans":539,"direction":92},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":226,"text":541,"spans":542,"direction":92},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":89,"text":544,"spans":545,"direction":92},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":89,"text":547,"spans":548,"direction":92},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":89,"text":514,"spans":550,"direction":92},[551,553],{"start":517,"end":518,"type":99,"data":552},{"link_type":36,"url":520,"target":102},{"start":517,"end":518,"type":105},{"questionTitle":555,"questionBody":556},"Can I track my international parcels?",[557],{"type":89,"text":558,"spans":559,"direction":92},"Yes. When sending a parcel to Italy, you can track it throughout its journey. Just add your tracking number on our international tracking page.",[560,565],{"start":561,"end":562,"type":99,"data":563},115,142,{"link_type":36,"url":564,"target":102},"italy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":561,"end":562,"type":105},{"title":567},"FAQs about sending parcels to Italy from the UK","frequently_asked_questions$b7f81eba-286b-4c68-a8bb-d0bf5d63c523","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,116,153,220,298,331,419,450,496],["Reactive",572],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":573,"$sclients":638,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":641},{"abtasty":574,"accessibe":577,"appPromoBanner":580,"autoDivertUpdates":583,"awin":586,"bulkInternational":589,"bulkSendEnabled":592,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":595,"enableBasketCount":598,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":601,"euCustomsDuty":604,"groovyAdvert":607,"newInternationalSendFlow":610,"newinternationalpages":616,"oohPreferenceFlag":620,"opentel":623,"premium":626,"savedCards":629,"smallParcelSize":632,"yourPricesDrawer":635},{"_createdAt":575,"_updatedAt":576,"enabled":146},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":578,"_updatedAt":579,"enabled":146},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":581,"_updatedAt":582,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":584,"_updatedAt":585,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":587,"_updatedAt":588,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":590,"_updatedAt":591,"enabled":146},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":593,"_updatedAt":594,"enabled":146},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":596,"_updatedAt":597,"enabled":146},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":599,"_updatedAt":600,"enabled":146},"20